e schedules place the official charge after the July trip", "text": "Airport collections", "mark": "Airport"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 0.99, 1.24, 1.53, 1.84, 2.17, 2.53, 2.68, 2.9, 3.14, 3.41, 3.61, 3.99]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A federal judge approved more than $1.8 million in refunds across California.", "t0": 18.47, "t1": 23.09, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "refund", "layout": "table", "heading": "California rider refunds", "context": "Federal settlement figures", "rows": [{"label": "Earlier estimate", "value": "$1,785,912.85"}, {"label": "Ordered", "value": "$1,814,909.55"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.53, 0.82, 1.19, 1.35, 1.56, 1.82, 2.09, 2.33, 2.7, 3.07, 3.2, 3.65, 3.99]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The earlier estimate covered 355,619 users.", "t0": 23.21, "t1": 27.72, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "refund", "kicker": "A federal judge approved $1,814,909.55 in refunds across California", "text": "Earlier estimate", "mark": "Earlier"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.52, 0.92, 1.23, 1.55, 1.88, 2.52, 2.99, 3.26, 3.57, 4.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Riders needed no claim form. Active accounts got a credit first.", "t0": 27.84, "t1": 31.61, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "distribution", "kicker": "Account credit and a cash refund followed different deadlines", "text": "Active accounts", "mark": "Active"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.74, 0.94, 1.25, 2.06, 2.43, 2.81, 3.0, 3.07, 3.39]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "After 365 days, unused credits moved to the payment account or a check.", "t0": 31.73, "t1": 36.16, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "distribution", "kicker": "Account credit and a cash refund followed different deadlines", "text": "Unused credits", "mark": "Unused"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.53, 0.79, 1.41, 2.08, 2.49, 2.89, 3.13, 3.23, 3.33, 3.64, 3.96, 4.09, 4.15]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "A separate county settlement required $10 million within 60 days.", "t0": 36.38, "t1": 40.23, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "judgment", "kicker": "A separate county enforcement judgment had only $10 million due unconditionally", "text": "County penalties", "mark": "County"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.49, 0.81, 1.28, 1.73, 1.99, 2.32, 2.67, 3.0, 3.42]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Another $15 million depended on a future violation.", "t0": 40.35, "t1": 43.53, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "judgment", "layout": "table", "heading": "County penalties", "context": "State consumer settlement", "rows": [{"label": "Due within 60 days", "value": "$10 million"}, {"label": "Conditional for two years", "value": "$15 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.85, 1.17, 1.51, 1.96, 2.1, 2.19, 2.52]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The records establish the refund order. Actual final distributions still need a receipt.", "t0": 43.65, "t1": 48.36, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final distributions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.54, 1.02, 1.16, 1.58, 2.36, 2.79, 3.1, 3.77, 4.04, 4.21, 4.31]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.48, "t1": 50.59, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A $4 airport toll appeared on a July 2014 ride to SFO", "b": "The airport’s own rate schedules place the official charge after the July trip", "o": "A separate county enforcement judgment had only $10 million due unconditionally"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}